'-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
' Compatibility shim
' Themes now live in InForm/themes and are loaded by InFormTheme.bm (included by InForm.ui).
' This file is kept so that programs generated by older versions of InForm-PE, which include
' 'InForm/xp.uitheme' directly, still compile. New programs don't need to include it.
'-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

$INCLUDEONCE

'$INCLUDE:'InFormTheme.bm'
